+# TLS certificate verification in development builds
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that testing uses self-signed certificates. The project also records that HTTPS is used everywhere with no plaintext exception, since proper certificate management is now in place. No separate setting for whether certificate verification is enabled or disabled in development builds is recorded beyond these two decisions.
